<title>RUSSIA: Russia's MGTS names Salomon to lead bond.</title>
<headline>Russia's MGTS names Salomon to lead bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moscow telephone company MGTS has selected U.S. investment bank Salomon Bros to lead a planned offering of its bonds on the Euromarkets, MGTS's financial adviser Guta-Invest said on Friday.</p>
</text>
